    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Every bottle holds a coarse hair from a storm giant's beard, coiled at the bottom.</p><p><em>Potion, Very Rare</em></p><p>When you drink this potion, your Strength score changes for 1 hour to 27. The type of giant determines the score. The potion has no effect on you if your Strength is equal to or greater than that score.</p><p>This potion's transparent liquid has floating in it a sliver of light resembling a giant's fingernail.</p>",
